  "name": "computer-aided-engineering-environment-caee-for-the-design-generation-of-individualized-shinguards",
  "notes": "This dataset contains a script or a Computer-Aided Engineering Environment (CAEE) for Grasshopper (plugin for Rhino), which allows the design of individualized shin guards based on a 3D scan of the leg.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis dataset contains the script of the CAEE and an example scan of a leg in .stl and .3dm.\r\n\r\n\r\n![Alt text](https://i.ibb.co/myd6bsH/GH-Skript.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n",
